Continuing the ship-agent loop for our release-notes agent. G12 passed last week: the agent reads merged PR titles from our private repo and writes a draft to a file, with no network and no write access to GitHub. The eval plan set a pass bar of 90% on the golden set, critical subset at 100%. The team has built it. Here is .claude/settings.json:

{"permissions": {"allow": ["Bash(git log:*)", "Bash(gh:*)", "Write(drafts/**)"], "defaultMode": "acceptEdits"}}

First eval run: 93% overall, critical subset 11 of 12. The owner is the platform lead.
